OL,3,AFive dead and dozens injured in coach
OL,4,Acrash in Swiss Alps
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive people have died and dozens are
OL,7,Finjured after a tourist coach crashed
OL,8,Fin the south-eastern Swiss Alps, police
OL,9,Fsay.
OL,11,FThe Dutch tour bus hit a safety barrier
OL,12,Fin a roadworks area, left the road and
OL,13,Foverturned between Susch and Zernez in
OL,14,Fthe Graubunden region late on Thursday
OL,15,Fafternoon.
OL,17,FSwiss police said on Friday that the
OL,18,Fdeceased had not yet been identified.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
