OL,3,AFive dead and dozens injured in coach
OL,4,Acrash in Swiss Alps
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey added that the other 40 people on
OL,7,Fboard the coach - whose injuries ranged
OL,8,Ffrom serious to minor - had been
OL,9,Ftransported to hospitals by rescue
OL,10,Fhelicopters and ambulance crews.
